# Example agent launch profile for `riddim start`.
# Copy this file to config/agent-profile (gitignored) and adjust it.
# One line in the <harness> <model> <effort> token order of Firstmate's
# config/secondmate-harness. Pi-only: exactly the pi harness is supported, and
# unlike Firstmate's secondmate-harness, all three tokens are required.
pi openrouter/z-ai/glm-5.3-flash max
